WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:02.736
[spaceship engines roar]

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:12.244
- WAIT, WAIT.

00:00:12.344 --> 00:00:13.979
WE GOT TO BE CAREFUL HERE.

00:00:14.079 --> 00:00:16.849
THIS PLACE IS CRAWLING
WITH THEM.

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:19.552
WHAT WAS THAT?
- WHAT?

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.421
- COVER ME.

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:28.995
- GUYS! HEY, GUYS!

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.865
HEY, GUYS.
OH, THANK GOD.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.400
HEY, WE STARTED
A COMMUNITY OF SURVIVORS.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.169
Y'ALL COME LIVE WITH US.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:51.850
- WAIT.
HOW DID YOU KNOW?

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.085
- COME ON.

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:56.189
REDNECK WANTS US TO MOVE
INTO HIS COMMUNITY?

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.358
US?
LET'S GO.

00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:08.033
- GUYS, OVER HERE!

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:11.203
OH, THANK GOD THERE ARE OTHERS!

00:01:11.303 --> 00:01:12.939
- WOULD YOU LET
ME DATE YOUR DAUGHTER?

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.808
- OF COURSE!

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:21.480
- OH, MY GOD. OH, MY GOD.
OH, MY GOD. OH, MY GOD.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.284
AAH!
PLEASE DON'T HURT ME!

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:26.552
MY BEST FRIEND IS BLACK
AND I LOVE JAY-Z,

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:31.257
AND MY FAVORITE MOVIE
IS<i> THINK LIKE A MAN.</i>

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.658
- SHE'S GOOD.
- COME WITH US.

00:01:32.758 --> 00:01:34.026
- OKAY.
- STAY CLOSE.

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:35.127
- OKAY.
- WHAT'S YOUR NAME?

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:37.030
- EMILY.
both: OF COURSE IT IS.

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:40.033
[tense dubstep music]

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:44.370
♪ ♪

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.438
- HEY, HEY, HEY!
DON'T SHOOT!

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:48.641
DON'T SHOOT!

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.910
- WHAT DO YOU THINK
ABOUT THE POLICE?

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.812
- WELL,
I LOVE THEIR THIRD ALBUM.

00:01:56.348 --> 00:01:57.283
- AAH! AAH!
[stammers]

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.852
I DON'T HAVE ANY MONEY!

00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:00.853
NO MONEY!

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:06.326
[screaming]

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:09.662
[continues screaming]

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:13.799
- OH, MY GOD. OH, MY GOD.

00:02:13.899 --> 00:02:15.201
THANK GOD YOU GUYS SHOWED UP.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.169
I GOT TO GET OUT OF HERE.

00:02:17.269 --> 00:02:18.805
IT'S A SILVER LEXUS.

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:20.539
JUST PULL IT RIGHT UP FRONT,

00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:22.175
AND DON'T SCUFF THE PAINT,
ALL RIGHT?

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.977
I JUST HAD IT BUFFED.

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:36.155
- WAS HE AN ALIEN, TOO?

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:38.491
- YEP.

